"U stelselinligting is na %s opgelaai. Hierdie skakel is op u knipbord "
"geplaas."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:528
msgid "An error occurred while uploading the system information"
msgstr "'n Fout het voorgekom tydens die oplaai van die stelselinligting"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:528
msgid ""
"Copy and paste the system information manually into a pastebin site like "
"https://pastebin.com."
msgstr ""
"Kopieer en plak die stelselinligting handmatig in 'n pastebin-werf soos "
"https://pastebin.com."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:624
msgid "Ignore this report"
msgstr "Ignoreer hierdie verslag"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:640
msgid "Are you sure you want to ignore this report?"
msgstr "Is u seker dat u hierdie verslag wil ignoreer?"

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:641
msgid "The report will be permanently ignored and will no longer be visible."
msgstr ""
"Die verslag sal permanent geïgnoreer word en sal nie meer sigbaar wees nie."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:730
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The debug symbols are missing for %(program)s.\n"
"Please install %(package)s."
msgstr ""
"Die ontfoutingssimbole ontbreek vir %(program)s.\n"
"Installeer asseblief %(package)s."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:744
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The package providing %s could not be found.\n"
"If you want to generate a stack trace for this crash report, please "
"reinstall it."
msgstr ""
"Die pakket wat %s verskaf, kon nie gevind word nie.\n"
"As u 'n stapelspoor vir hierdie ineenstortingsverslag wil genereer, "
"herinstalleer dit asseblief."

#: usr/lib/linuxmint/mintreport/app.py:772
msgid ""
"The headers or binaries installed on your system do not match the code which "
"was executed during the crash.\n"
"They probably got upgraded since.\n"
"A stack trace is available in 'Local Files' but its content is probably "
"inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"Die kopstukke of binêre lêers wat op u stelsel geïnstalleer is, stem nie "
"ooreen met die kode wat tydens die ineenstorting uitgevoer is nie.\n"
"Hulle is waarskynlik sedertdien opgegradeer.\n"
"'n Stapelspoor is beskikbaar in 'Plaaslike lêers', maar die inhoud is "
"waarskynlik onakkuraat."

