#, python-brace-format
msgid "It will stop receiving support and updates in a day."
msgid_plural "It will stop receiving support and updates in {num_days} days."
msgstr[0] ""
"Dit sal oor 'n dag ophou om ondersteuning en opdaterings te ontvang."
